3. 🔌 MCP chatbot

MCP solves a different problem.

Imagine your chatbot needs access to:

                 MCP
                  ↓
       ┌──────────┼──────────┐
       ↓          ↓          ↓
   Database     Weather    EV API
       ↓          ↓          ↓
              AI Agent

Instead of writing a completely different custom connection for every external system, MCP provides a standard way for an AI application to use tools and resources exposed by MCP servers.

======

⭐ The important difference

Think of a restaurant:

LangChain = Waiter's toolbox 🧰
Helps the waiter interact with available services/tools.

LangGraph = Restaurant manager 👨‍💼
Decides:

"First take the order → send to kitchen → check status → serve → handle problem."

MCP = Standard doorway to outside services 🚪
Provides a common way to connect the restaurant to external systems.

========

